187
00:08:33,563 --> 00:08:35,563
Oh, we made it back before Oliver.

188
00:08:35,563 --> 00:08:36,563
Thanks, Pig.

189
00:08:36,563 --> 00:08:37,563
No problem.

190
00:08:37,563 --> 00:08:39,163
Uh, want some help cleaning up?

191
00:08:39,167 --> 00:08:40,167
Sure, thanks.

192
00:08:43,667 --> 00:08:45,007
There's not that much to clean.

193
00:08:45,007 --> 00:08:46,467
It's a little crayon mess.

194
00:08:46,467 --> 00:08:49,147
Gah!

195
00:08:49,151 --> 00:08:51,531
If this is what you call a little mess,

196
00:08:51,611 --> 00:08:53,371
I don't want to see a big one.

197
00:08:53,451 --> 00:08:54,531
What am I going to do?

198
00:08:54,611 --> 00:08:56,911
Oliver and Mom will be here any minute.

199
00:08:56,991 --> 00:08:59,131
Oh, it's coming back.

200
00:08:59,135 --> 00:09:04,135
How did you do that?

201
00:09:04,135 --> 00:09:06,135
Yoga.

202
00:09:06,135 --> 00:09:09,115
Okay, the important thing is to do

203
00:09:09,119 --> 00:09:11,119
One thing is not to panic.

204
00:09:12,499 --> 00:09:14,499
Don't panic, deep breaths.

205
00:09:17,299 --> 00:09:19,099
Okay, I'm breathing.

206
00:09:19,103 --> 00:09:22,103
But the house is still a mess, and Oliver is going to be here any--

207
00:09:22,103 --> 00:09:23,343
Ah!

208
00:09:23,343 --> 00:09:24,683
He's here.

209
00:09:24,683 --> 00:09:26,223
Hello?

210
00:09:26,223 --> 00:09:26,763
Whew.

211
00:09:26,763 --> 00:09:29,083
That's not Oliver.

212
00:09:29,087 --> 00:09:34,087
No, but it is the solution to our problems.

213
00:09:34,087 --> 00:09:38,087
Hello! We just wanted to say thank you for helping us!

214
00:09:38,087 --> 00:09:39,067
Ooh!

215
00:09:39,071 --> 00:09:40,311
You're just who we needed.

216
00:09:49,055 --> 00:09:59,035
They're coming! Let me excuse them! They're coming! What are you doing? What are you doing? They're coming! The cramless! It's still there!

217
00:09:59,039 --> 00:10:04,039
- That does not sound good.

218
00:10:07,039 --> 00:10:09,019
-

219
00:10:09,023 --> 00:10:13,023
Wow. Mouse, you did a great job

220
00:10:13,023 --> 00:10:15,023
