226
00:10:27,007 --> 00:10:28,987
You guys really came to my rest.

227
00:10:28,991 --> 00:10:30,491
Rescue you?

228
00:10:30,591 --> 00:10:32,331
I guess I kind of did.

229
00:10:32,431 --> 00:10:35,971
Hey, I kind of like being a superhero.

230
00:10:36,071 --> 00:10:37,271
Look at me.

231
00:10:37,371 --> 00:10:38,971
I'm the Caped Moon.

232
00:10:38,975 --> 00:10:41,475
Or maybe heroic moose.

233
00:10:41,475 --> 00:10:43,475
Boy, this is gonna take some thought.

234
00:10:43,475 --> 00:10:45,475
Oh, I want a costume too.

235
00:10:45,475 --> 00:10:48,955
Maybe some sparkle shoes that can make me spin it.

236
00:10:48,959 --> 00:10:51,459
- We should all have costumes.

237
00:10:51,459 --> 00:10:52,839
- And superpowers.

238
00:10:52,839 --> 00:10:54,259
- Yes, superpowers.

239
00:10:54,259 --> 00:10:55,959
- In our own comic book.

240
00:10:55,959 --> 00:10:57,959
- That's a great idea.

241
00:10:57,959 --> 00:10:58,939
- I love it.

242
00:10:58,943 --> 00:11:00,943
Great idea! We can draw one.

243
00:11:00,943 --> 00:11:03,943
And if we're going to draw a comic book, then...

244
00:11:07,943 --> 00:11:08,923
Oh, hi, Oliver.

245
00:11:08,927 --> 00:11:13,927
Hi, Oliver.

246
00:11:13,927 --> 00:11:16,927
What are you guys doing in here?

247
00:11:16,927 --> 00:11:18,907
Nothing.

248
00:11:18,911 --> 00:11:22,911
-

249
00:11:22,911 --> 00:11:26,911
- Oh, uh, Oliver, can we have a crayon?

250
00:11:26,911 --> 00:11:28,891
Thanks, Oliver.

251
00:11:28,895 --> 00:11:30,195
This is so awesome!

252
00:11:30,515 --> 00:11:34,035
If you give a mouse a crayon, then what do you think will happen next?

253
00:11:38,879 --> 00:11:40,879
Almost.

254
00:11:40,879 --> 00:11:42,879
Come on, come on, come on.

255
00:11:46,879 --> 00:11:48,859
Woo-hoo!

256
00:11:48,863 --> 00:11:52,703
- Good morning, Oliver. - Good morning, Mouse.

257
00:11:53,663 --> 00:11:56,163
Listen, it's morning music!

258
00:11:56,243 --> 00:11:58,843
And if I hear morning music, then...

259
00:11:58,847 --> 00:11:59,847
Woo-hoo!

260
00:11:59,847 --> 00:12:01,847
Morning dance, morning dance.

261
00:12:01,847 --> 00:12:03,847
Ooh, ooh!

262
00:12:03,847 --> 00:12:08,827
You just have to dance.

263
00:12:08,831 --> 00:12:09,671
Ha!

264
00:12:14,671 --> 00:12:16,011
All aboard!

265
00:12:17,331 --> 00:12:18,811
Woo-hoo-hoo-hoo!

266
00:12:18,815 --> 00:12:28,795
- Woo!

267
00:12:28,799 --> 00:12:33,799
- Say cheese!

268
00:12:37,799 --> 00:12:38,779
- Whoa!

269
00:12:38,783 --> 00:12:43,783
- Lookin' good.

270
00:12:43,783 --> 00:12:48,763
- Ready? - Ready.

271
00:12:48,767 --> 00:12:50,767
Woohoo!

272
00:12:50,767 --> 00:12:52,767
Woohoo!

273
00:12:52,767 --> 00:12:54,767
Woohoo!

274
00:12:54,767 --> 00:12:56,767
Woohoo!

275
00:12:56,767 --> 00:12:58,767
